Z||000001||artherd||09-07-2001||09:27 PM||||Hrm, wasn't aware the Fiero had these, where do they go?<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85GT4ME:<BR><B>Is anyone else running thier fiero without these chatter clips if so I feel just as bad for you as I do for myself.  Oh yea my point is if anyone has one that they can spare I would gladly pay s/h.  I bet most are just like me just trying to keep it alive and refusing to trade it for anything.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
